//! The gateway's configuration: `types` (what an operator can set, serde-friendly), `builder` (the
//! hand-written `RouterConfigBuilder`; a field has no setter until one is written), `validation`
//! (`ConfigValidator`, run by `build()` for the CLI and the Python bindings alike) and `bounds`.
//! Every field is reached by two paths, the CLI in `main.rs` and the Python `Router` in
//! `bindings/python/src/lib.rs`; a field that only one of them sets is a bug.
